				<section class="elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-1f46257 elementor-section-stretched elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default" data-id="1f46257" data-element_type="section" data-settings="{&quot;stretch_section&quot;:&quot;section-stretched&quot;,&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
							<div class="elementor-background-overlay"></div>
							<div class="elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default">
							<div class="elementor-row">
					<div class="elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-2489536" data-id="2489536" data-element_type="column">
			<div class="elementor-column-wrap elementor-element-populated">
							<div class="elementor-widget-wrap">
						<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-b3f4b2c elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="b3f4b2c" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
			<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">What Parents say about us</h2>		</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-d9dec9c elementor-widget elementor-widget-lae-testimonials-slider" data-id="d9dec9c" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="lae-testimonials-slider.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
			<div class="lae-testimonials-slider lae-flexslider lae-container" data-settings="{&quot;slide_animation&quot;:&quot;slide&quot;,&quot;direction&quot;:&quot;horizontal&quot;,&quot;slideshow_speed&quot;:5000,&quot;animation_speed&quot;:600,&quot;control_nav&quot;:true,&quot;direction_nav&quot;:true,&quot;pause_on_hover&quot;:true,&quot;pause_on_action&quot;:false}"><div class="lae-slides"><div class="lae-slide lae-testimonial-wrapper"><div class="lae-testimonial"><div class="lae-testimonial-text"><i class="lae-icon-quote"></i><p>I see tremendous improvement in my child and all the credit goes to the family of SKS World. I feel vindicated to have enrolled her here.</p></div><div class="lae-testimonial-user"><div class="lae-image-wrapper"></div><!-- .lae-image-wrapper --><div class="lae-text"><h4 class="lae-author-name">Mr. Mukesh Sharma</h4><div class="lae-author-credentials">(F/O. Khushi Sharma , CLASS – lV-A)</div></div></div><!-- .lae-testimonial-user --></div><!-- .lae-testimonial --></div><!-- .lae-testimonial-wrapper.lae-slide --><div class="lae-slide lae-testimonial-wrapper"><div class="lae-testimonial"><div class="lae-testimonial-text"><i class="lae-icon-quote"></i><p>My child always talks about school and the work he is doing, he is getting on really well. I am so pleased with how my child has progressed, thank you.</p></div><div class="lae-testimonial-user"><div class="lae-image-wrapper"></div><!-- .lae-image-wrapper --><div class="lae-text"><h4 class="lae-author-name">Mr. Rakesh singh</h4><div class="lae-author-credentials">(F/O Shaurya Singh, Class Pre Nursery)</div></div></div><!-- .lae-testimonial-user --></div><!-- .lae-testimonial --></div><!-- .lae-testimonial-wrapper.lae-slide --><div class="lae-slide lae-testimonial-wrapper"><div class="lae-testimonial"><div class="lae-testimonial-text"><i class="lae-icon-quote"></i><p>We just wanted to thank all the staff at SKS World School. I am amazed at the great progress Yashil has made since joining in October. He loves being at school and tells me it’s “just like being at home, being part of a family”. I feel the great sense of community that runs throughout the school from teachers and staff, makes SKS World School very special.</p></div><div class="lae-testimonial-user"><div class="lae-image-wrapper"></div><!-- .lae-image-wrapper --><div class="lae-text"><h4 class="lae-author-name">Mrs. URVI RASTOGI SHARMA</h4><div class="lae-author-credentials">(M/o Yashil, Class Pre-Nursery)</div></div></div><!-- .lae-testimonial-user --></div><!-- .lae-testimonial --></div><!-- .lae-testimonial-wrapper.lae-slide --><div class="lae-slide lae-testimonial-wrapper"><div class="lae-testimonial"><div class="lae-testimonial-text"><i class="lae-icon-quote"></i><p>My ward is doing well in her studies & ma’am has also shown her great efforts.</p></div><div class="lae-testimonial-user"><div class="lae-image-wrapper"></div><!-- .lae-image-wrapper --><div class="lae-text"><h4 class="lae-author-name">Mr. Vivek</h4><div class="lae-author-credentials">(F/O Aaradya, class I- D)</div></div></div><!-- .lae-testimonial-user --></div><!-- .lae-testimonial --></div><!-- .lae-testimonial-wrapper.lae-slide --><div class="lae-slide lae-testimonial-wrapper"><div class="lae-testimonial"><div class="lae-testimonial-text"><i class="lae-icon-quote"></i><p>I am very happy to see my child growth & skill. Thanks to all teachers & school.</p></div><div class="lae-testimonial-user"><div class="lae-image-wrapper"></div><!-- .lae-image-wrapper --><div class="lae-text"><h4 class="lae-author-name">Mrs. Reetu</h4><div class="lae-author-credentials">( M/O Mudit Batsh, Class Nursery)</div></div></div><!-- .lae-testimonial-user --></div><!-- .lae-testimonial --></div><!-- .lae-testimonial-wrapper.lae-slide --><div class="lae-slide lae-testimonial-wrapper"><div class="lae-testimonial"><div class="lae-testimonial-text"><i class="lae-icon-quote"></i><p>Thanks ma’am for your support Naisha is doing well. We are satisfied with her growth.</p></div><div class="lae-testimonial-user"><div class="lae-image-wrapper"></div><!-- .lae-image-wrapper --><div class="lae-text"><h4 class="lae-author-name">Mr. Amit Roy Choudhary</h4><div class="lae-author-credentials">(F/O Naisha Roy, Class Nursery A)</div></div></div><!-- .lae-testimonial-user --></div><!-- .lae-testimonial --></div><!-- .lae-testimonial-wrapper.lae-slide --><div class="lae-slide lae-testimonial-wrapper"><div class="lae-testimonial"><div class="lae-testimonial-text"><i class="lae-icon-quote"></i><p>School is considered the place where the tiny tots get the wings to fly. SKS World School has proved to be that platform for my child. Right from academies to extra curricular activities, there is a great improvement and participation seen. Happy and satisfied with the infrastructure, teaching methodology and environment. Keep up the good work, Team!</p></div><div class="lae-testimonial-user"><div class="lae-image-wrapper"></div><!-- .lae-image-wrapper --><div class="lae-text"><h4 class="lae-author-name">Mr. Upendra Singh Dhapola</h4><div class="lae-author-credentials">(f/o Hridhaan Singh Dhapola, Class Pre Nur)</div></div></div><!-- .lae-testimonial-user --></div><!-- .lae-testimonial --></div><!-- .lae-testimonial-wrapper.lae-slide --><div class="lae-slide lae-testimonial-wrapper"><div class="lae-testimonial"><div class="lae-testimonial-text"><i class="lae-icon-quote"></i><p>Nice school in greater noida west,My daughter Manushree is in class 1st E.Teachers at SKS World School are loving, caring, patient, and very creative! They are always attentive to individual kids needs. We love that there are multiple Educational club, dancing and singing ,etc. Each performance truly shows SKS teachers’ dedication and effort as they bring out the talents from kids. Overall, we are above and beyond grateful for SKS World School Team!  </p></div><div class="lae-testimonial-user"><div class="lae-image-wrapper"></div><!-- .lae-image-wrapper --><div class="lae-text"><h4 class="lae-author-name">Mr. Harish Parihar</h4><div class="lae-author-credentials">F/O. Manushree Parihar, Class – I-E</div></div></div><!-- .lae-testimonial-user --></div><!-- .lae-testimonial --></div><!-- .lae-testimonial-wrapper.lae-slide --></div><!-- .lae-slides --></div><!-- .lae-testimonials-slider -->		</div>
				</div>
						</div>
					</div>
		</div>
								</div>
					</div>
		</section>
						</div>
						</div>
					</div>
		</div><!-- .inner-wrapper --></div><!-- .container --></div><!-- #content -->
	<div id="footer-widgets"><div class="container"><div class="inner-wrapper"><div class="footer-active-4 footer-widget-area"><aside id="text-11" class="widget widget_text"><h3 class="widget-title">About School</h3>			<div class="textwidget"><p>SKS World School, Greater Noida West was established in the year 2015 and is now the oldest, best and most well established CBSE Affiliated, Co-Educational English Medium School in Greater Noida West.</p>
<p>SKS World School Greater Noida West has been Strategically set up at a traffic free stretch of:</p>
<ul>
<li><i></i> 3 Km from Crossing Republik (Gzb.)</li>
<li><i></i> 5 Km from Sector – 119, Noida</li>
<li><i></i> 7.5 Km from Sector 51/52/71/72 Noida</li>
<li><i></i> 9 Km from Noida City Centre</li>
<li><i></i> 12 Kms from Sector 62, Noida</li>
</ul>
</div>
		</aside></div><!-- .footer-widget-area --><div class="footer-active-4 footer-widget-area"><aside id="nav_menu-2" class="widget widget_nav_menu"><h3 class="widget-title">Important Links</h3><div class="menu-importants-links-container"><ul id="menu-importants-links" class="menu"><li id="menu-item-5385" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-5385"><a href="our-group-of-institutions/">SKS Group of Institutions</a></li>
